<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Fee Waiver Request</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .form-row td:first-child {
    width: 150px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">CALIFORNIA STATE UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">SAN BERNARDINO</h2>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Student Fee Waiver Request</h3>
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin: 0;">OVER 60 PROGRAM</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">This waiver form must be submitted to the Office of the Registrar in UH-171.</p>

  <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">(Please Print Clearly)</p>

  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="form-row">
        <td>NAME</td>
        <td><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="form-row">
        <td>ADDRESS</td>
        <td><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="form-row">
        <td>PHONE NUMBER:</td>
        <td><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="form-row">
        <td>MYCOYOTE E-MAIL ADDRESS</td>
        <td><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="form-row">
        <td>DATE OF BIRTH:</td>
        <td><span data-field="dob">{{ dob }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="form-row">
        <td>QUARTER & YEAR FOR WHICH YOU ARE APPLYING:</td>
        <td>QTR: <span data-field="quarter">{{ quarter }}</span> / YEAR: <span data-field="year">{{ year }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="form-row">
        <td>DEGREE OBJECTIVE:</td>
        <td><span data-field="degree_objective">{{ degree_objective }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">LAST</td>
        <td style="width: 35%; text-align: center;">FIRST</td>
        <td style="width: 35%;">MIDDLE INITIAL</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="last_name">{{ last_name }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="middle_initial">{{ middle_initial }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">PHONE NUMBER:</td>
        <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="phone_number_work">{{ phone_number_work }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>MYCOYOTE E-MAIL ADDRESS</td>
        <td><span data-field="email_work">{{ email_work }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>DATE OF BIRTH:</td>
        <td><span data-field="dob_work">{{ dob_work }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>QUARTER & YEAR FOR WHICH YOU ARE APPLYING:</td>
        <td>QTR: <span data-field="quarter_work">{{ quarter_work }}</span> / YEAR: <span data-field="year_work">{{ year_work }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>DEGREE OBJECTIVE:</td>
        <td><span data-field="degree_objective_work">{{ degree_objective_work }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">STUDENT'S SIGNATURE:</p>
    <div class="signature-line" data-field="student_s_signature">{{ student_s_signature }}</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px;">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">REGISTRATION INFORMATION</h3>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">Persons enrolling in the program will be able to register using the MyCoyote on-line registration system.</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">mycoyote.csusb.edu</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">However, because students in this program pay a reduced fee, their registration time will be during Priority 5 registration. If a student applies to this program after priority registration has ended, they will then register during the open and/or late registration periods, which require pre-payment of fees. However, the $25.00 late fee will be waived.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Questions regarding the Over 60 Program should be addressed to the Program Coordinator, <span data-field="coordinator_name">{{ coordinator_name }}</span>, at <span data-field="coordinator_email">{{ coordinator_email }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>To submit this request by mail, please address to:</p>
    <p>Attn: <span data-field="attn_name">{{ attn_name }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="office_name">{{ office_name }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>